bottomparticipants 

actor Author
boundary "Author Statistics Page" as UI
boundary Router
control MangaController
control MangaService
entity ":MangaModel" as MangaModel
entity ":ChapterModel" as ChapterModel
database MongoDB

Author -> UI: 1. Open Author Statistics page
activate Author
activate UI

    UI -> Router: 2. GET /api/manga/author/{AuthorId}/stats
    activate Router

    Router -> MangaController: 3. getAuthorStats(AuthorId)
    activate MangaController

    MangaController -> MangaService: 4. getAuthorStatistics(AuthorId)
    activate MangaService

    MangaService -> MangaModel: 5. Count total stories by author
    activate MangaModel
    MangaModel -> MongoDB: 6. Query stories
    activate MongoDB
    MongoDB --> MangaModel: 7. Story list
    deactivate MongoDB
    MangaModel --> MangaService: 8. totalStories
    deactivate MangaModel

    MangaService -> MangaModel: 9. Count published stories
    activate MangaModel
    MangaModel -> MongoDB: 10. Query status=published
    activate MongoDB
    MongoDB --> MangaModel: 11. Result
    deactivate MongoDB
    MangaModel --> MangaService: 12. publishedStories
    deactivate MangaModel

    MangaService -> ChapterModel: 13. Count chapters by author stories
    activate ChapterModel
    ChapterModel -> MongoDB: 14. Query chapters
    activate MongoDB
    MongoDB --> ChapterModel: 15. Result
    deactivate MongoDB
    ChapterModel --> MangaService: 16. totalChapters
    deactivate ChapterModel

    MangaService -> MangaModel: 17. Sum views of all stories
    activate MangaModel
    MangaModel-> MongoDB: 18. Aggregate views
    activate MongoDB
    MongoDB --> MangaModel: 19. Result
    deactivate MongoDB
    MangaModel--> MangaService: 20. totalViews
    deactivate MangaModel

    MangaService -> MangaModel: 21. Count stories by status
    activate MangaModel
    MangaModel -> MongoDB: 22. Query ongoing/completed/hiatus
    activate MongoDB
    MongoDB --> MangaModel: 23. Result
    deactivate MongoDB
    MangaModel --> MangaService: 24. statusBreakdown
    deactivate MangaModel

    MangaService -> MangaService: 25. Calculate avgViewsPerStory
    activate MangaService
    space
    deactivate MangaService

    MangaService --> MangaController: 26. Return statistics DTO
    deactivate MangaService

    MangaController --> Router: 27. HTTP 200 JSON response
    deactivate MangaController

    Router --> UI: 28. Statistics data
    deactivate Router

    UI -> UI: 29. Render statistics cards
    activate UI
    space 
    deactivate UI
    
    UI --> Author:30. Display author statistics

deactivate UI
deactivate Author